d":"/auto-compact-27","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#technical-details","content":"Trigger: You choose either “Compact task” (inline) or “New task with summary”."},"30":{"id":"/auto-compact-28","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#technical-details","content":"Summary prompt: Pochi asks the model to produce a concise recap focused on key topics, decisions, and important context (limited to a few thousand tokens of output)."},"31":{"id":"/auto-compact-29","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#technical-details","content":"Inline compact: The recap is wrapped in a compact block and prepended to your last user message before the next response."},"32":{"id":"/auto-compact-30","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#technical-details","content":"New task: The recap becomes the first message of a brand-new task, followed by a short instruction letting the agent analyze status and confirm next steps."},"33":{"id":"/auto-compact-31","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#technical-details","content":"Safety/availability: Buttons are disabled during streaming/execution, or when below the minimum token threshold."},"34":{"id":"/auto-compact-32","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#tips","content":"Prefer inline compact when you want continuity within the same task."},"35":{"id":"/auto-compact-33","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#tips","content":"Use “new task with summary” to cleanly branch, hand over, or checkpoint work."},"36":{"id":"/auto-compact-34","page_id":"/auto-compact","type":"text","url":"/auto-compact#tips","content":"You’ll see a “Compacting” state while the summary is being generated—this can take a moment for very long threads."},"37":{"id":"/checkpoint","page_id":"/checkpoint","type":"page","content":"Checkpoints","url":"/checkpoint"},"38":{"id":"/checkpoint-0","page_id":"/checkpoint","type"