-language-support","content":"Works across popular programming languages including:"},"411":{"id":"/tab-completion-15","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"JavaScript/TypeScript"},"412":{"id":"/tab-completion-16","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"Python"},"413":{"id":"/tab-completion-17","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"Java"},"414":{"id":"/tab-completion-18","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"C/C++"},"415":{"id":"/tab-completion-19","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"Go"},"416":{"id":"/tab-completion-20","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"Rust"},"417":{"id":"/tab-completion-21","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#multi-language-support","content":"And many more"},"418":{"id":"/tab-completion-22","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#using-tab-completion","content":"Just start typing. Pochi will surface suggestions automatically. The more you use it, the more it understands your codebase, thus suggesting better edits."},"419":{"id":"/tab-completion-23","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#keyboard-shortcuts","content":"Key"},"420":{"id":"/tab-completion-24","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#keyboard-shortcuts","content":"Action"},"421":{"id":"/tab-completion-25","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#keyboard-shortcuts","content":"Tab"},"422":{"id":"/tab-completion-26","page_id":"/tab-completion","type":"text","url":"/tab-completion#keyboard-shortcuts","content":"Accept the current suggestion"},"423":{"id":"/tab-completion-27","page_id":"/tab-c