🇸 🇨🇳 🇯🇵 🇰🇷. Want your language included? Open a PR! #90"},"507":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-10","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"CLI upgrades: The Pochi CLI got a big boost this week!"},"508":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-11","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Install via Homebrew 🍺 #125"},"509":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-12","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Authenticate with pochi auth, including support for Gemini login #167"},"510":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-13","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Trigger workflows directly with pochi -p \"/create-pr\" #110"},"511":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-14","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Enhanced Background jobs: Added terminal integration and lifecycle controls. Enhanced the job UI with collapsible detail logs and readable IDs for a clearer experience. #81, #97"},"512":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-15","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Autocomplete: Pochi suggests relevant tools, functions, and variables to help you type prompts faster. #89"},"513":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-16","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#enhancements-","content":"Documentation updates: Refreshed CLI usage docs, expanded model provider configuration examples, and added Slack integration documentation. #133, #141, #82"},"514":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-17","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#bug-fixes-","content":"File writing reliability: The CLI ensures directories exist before writing, so writeToFile tool won't fail. #118"},"515":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-18","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#bug-fixes-","content":"Code completion fix: Corrected how VS Code calculates the replacement range for suggestions, so completions insert correctly. #131"},"516":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2-19","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2","type":"text","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-05-weekly-update-2#new-contributors-","content":"@karim-coder made their first contribution this week! Welcome aboard! 🎉"},"517":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3","type":"page","content":"Weekly Update","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3"},"518":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3-0","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3","type":"heading","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3#weekly-update-3","content":"Weekly Update #3"},"519":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3-1","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3","type":"heading","url":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3#tldr","content":"TL;DR"},"520":{"id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3-2","page_id":"/developer-updates/2025-09-12-weekly-update-3","type":"heading","url":"/dev